==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~20.67 seconds<sup>600f~620f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~20.67 seconds<sup>600f~620f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This is a very easy stage. Make use of any meatshields and [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] cats at your disposal and you should win.

